"Sts. Bernard of Clairvaux, Stephen Harding, Aelred of Rievaulx, Lutgarde": "San Bernardo de Claraval, san Esteban Harding, san Elredo de Rieval, santa Lutgarda",
"1664 (reform); separate order 1892": "1664 (reforma); orden independiente en 1892",
