"Beneath Your Compassion": "Bajo tu amparo",
"Most Holy Theotokos, save us": "Santísima Theotokos, sálvanos",
"More honorable than the Cherubim, and beyond compare more glorious than the Seraphim.": "Más venerable que los querubines e incomparablemente más gloriosa que los serafines.",
